!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: HEK and 3T3 mix at a final concentration of 12.5 cells / ul in droplets.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Single cell suspensions were processed through Drop-Seq to generate single-cell cDNA libraries attached to microbeads
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Microbeads were counted, and amplified (estimated 570 cells) by PCR, and the 3' end of the cDNA prepared for sequencing using a modified Nextera XT protocol.
!Sample_data_processing = Base calls performed with bcl2fastq2.15
!Sample_data_processing = Read 2 was aligned with Star v2.4.0
!Sample_data_processing = Each aligned read was tagged with its mate-pair UMI and cell barcode.
!Sample_data_processing = Each aligned exonic read was tagged with a gene name
!Sample_data_processing = A digital expression matrix was built by counting the number of unique UMIs per gene within each cell; columns are cells, and rows are genes.  Gene expression from each organism is listed in a separate file.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10 and hg19 (dual reference)
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: compressed, flat text file with tab delimiters
